# ---- HOST-NATIVE STATION (de-bridged 2026-08-12, conversion campaign) ----
# MAME 0.289's ql runs ON THE HOST — the apt-0.251 pin dissolves with the
# kiosk, and the FIFO audio path removes the dbus fragility the bridge tile
# carried. drawshm frames, ctlsock keys through the generated keymap.
# Launcher: shared stations/mame-native/x11-runtime.sh; reset = relaunch
# restoring the golden savestate.
SH_RESET_MODE=relaunch
SH_FIXTURE_DESC=Sinclair QL 80-column MONITOR-mode SuperBASIC screen (white window #2, red window #1, empty black command window) drawn by MAME 0.289's `ql` driver running HOST-NATIVE (drawshm) on the published 1024x768 surface; the golden savestate restores it. No post-restore keys. The host-native binary carries mame-irix-skip-warnings.patch, so the imperfect-dump warning the bridge's apt 0.251 had to dismiss with a letter never exists; the one keystroke that reaches the scene — F1 to answer the QL's monitor/TV chooser — happens once, during the bake. hal16l8.ic38 (the undumped PAL) remains the romset's only missing member by design.
MAME_NATIVE_BIN=/data/vms/streamhost/assets/sinclairql/mame-native/ql
MAME_NATIVE_DRIVER=ql
MAME_NATIVE_ROMS=/data/vms/streamhost/assets/sinclairql/mame-native/roms
MAME_NATIVE_GEOM=1024x768
MAME_NATIVE_SKIP_WARNINGS=1
SH_MAMECTL_SOCK=/data/vms/streamhost/stations/sinclairql/ctl.sock
SH_MAMESOCK_KEYMAP=/data/vms/streamhost/stations/sinclairql/sinclairql.keymap
SH_AUDIO_SOURCE=fifo
SH_AUDIO_FIFO=/data/vms/streamhost/stations/sinclairql/audio.fifo

# ---- KEYBOARD PACING (the exhibit's only input surface) ----
SH_KEY_MIN_HOLD_MS=120
SH_KEY_MIN_GAP_MS=120
